WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.700
You shipped the work. Then came the questions.

00:02.700 --> 00:05.500
Where is that setting? What happens next?

00:05.500 --> 00:08.700
Turn the walkthrough into a handover people can follow.

00:08.700 --> 00:13.400
Choose screen recording or capture a searchable browser walkthrough.

00:13.400 --> 00:16.400
Replay the flow.

00:16.400 --> 00:21.150
Add a note at the exact moment that matters.

00:21.150 --> 00:24.700
Review captured text before you share.

00:24.700 --> 00:30.500
Keep your recordings together and find the context when you need it.

00:30.500 --> 00:32.400
Recordings start private.

00:32.400 --> 00:35.500
Create a viewer link when you're ready.

00:35.500 --> 00:40.500
Handover. Record once, keep the whole story.
